        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization / governance execution",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "The core team drew an $8M DEX Lite credit line and had members personally guarantee bad debt before DAO votes concluded, demonstrating that consequential financial decisions can bypass on-chain governance when the team judges speed necessary.",
